<title>UK: BOE details conversion of 2013/17 stock to 2015.</title>
<headline>BOE details conversion of 2013/17 stock to 2015.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said acceptances had been received to convert about 942 million stg of 12 percent Exchequer stock due 2013/17, 94.2 percent of the total outstanding, into 8.0 percent Treasury stock due 2015.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
